       "smarts": 3,
       "school": 5,
       "happiness": 3
      },
      "relationship": {
       "teacher": 20
      }
     },
     {
      "text": "I burned out by spring and the teacher gently suggested I rest. I hadn't realised how much I'd been pushing.",
      "weight": 1,
